   "label": "f02-clean-newlines",
   "front": "What does FileStorage.clean protect against when saving?",
   "back": "It replaces line breaks with spaces (and null with an empty string) so every saved value stays on one key=value line. A newline inside a title would otherwise split the record and corrupt the next load.",
